      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's possible your current dose isn't fully managing your blood pressure, so your dizziness could be related to that instability. However, increasing your lisinopril dose by 10mg without consulting your doctor is a dangerous idea. You should definitely discuss your fluctuating blood pressure and dizziness with your healthcare provider before making any changes. They can safely adjust your dosage to achieve the target range.",
      "source": "target",
